  },
  "tam": {
   "nodes": {
    "start": {
     "text": "The light's gone out. I can think again. My lord, we're cold. We've been cold for days and the cold is in our hands. Look at my hands.",
     "next": "b"
    },
    "b": {
     "who": "hero",
     "text": "Grey to the wrist. The fen dead had the same.",
     "choices": [
      {
       "text": "Edda, can your lamp do anything for them?",
       "if": {
        "companion": "Sister Edda Vey"
       },
       "do": [
        {
         "flag": "tam_decided"
        },
        {
         "flag": "folk_saved"
        },
        {
         "leave": "walked_away",
         "to": "stilt_market"
        },
        {
         "leave": "tam",
         "to": "stilt_market"
        },
        {
         "xp": 150
        }
       ],
       "next": "saved"
      },
      {
       "text": "Walk to Stilt Market. Keep to the boards and don't stop.",
       "do": [
        {
         "flag": "tam_decided"
        },
        {
         "flag": "folk_home"
        },
        {
         "leave": "walked_away",
         "to": "stilt_market"
        },
        {
         "leave": "tam",
         "to": "stilt_market"
        }
       ],
       "next": "home"
      },
      {
       "text": "There's nothing left to save. Rest now, Tam.",
       "do": [
        {
         "flag": "tam_decided"
        },
        {
         "flag": "folk_rested"
        },
        {
         "remove": "walked_away"
        },
        {
         "remove": "tam"
        }
       ],
       "next": "rest"
      }
     ]
    },
    "saved": {
     "text": "Warm. That's warm. Thank you, sister. Thank you, my lord. Take this, it's Brackwater's luck. It never did us any good, maybe it'll do you some."
    },
    "home": {
     "text": "The boards. Yes. Come on, all of you. Don't look at the water."
    },
    "rest": {
     "who": "hero",
     "text": "It was quick. It was the kindest thing left in this fen."
    }
   }
  },
  "tam_idle": {
   "nodes": {
    "start": {
     "text": "We'll walk on. Slowly."
    }
   }
  },
  "corvin_parley": {
   "nodes": {
    "start": {
     "who": "corvin",
     "text": "Wren. You put out my lanterns. All that work, and you blew them out like birthday candles.",
     "next": "b"
    },
    "b": {
     "who": "corvin",
     "text": "Do you know what a lantern-priest is for, my lord? We sit by the fen and watch the lights. For three hundred years we watched. And this summer the ground started breathing.",
     "choices": [
      {
       "text": "What is under the fen, Corvin?",
       "do": [
        {
         "flag": "heard_leak"
        }
       ],
       "next": "leak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Corvin. It's Edda.",
       "if": {
        "companion": "Sister Edda Vey"
       },
       "next": "edda"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enough. Stand and fight.",
       "next": "end"
      }
     ]
    },
    "leak": {
     "who": "corvin",
     "text": "Not under. Through. There are cracks down there older than your crown, and something is coming up through them like water through a hull. The dead feel it first. I only gave them lanterns to walk by.",
     "next": "end"
    },
    "edda": {
     "who": "corvin",
     "text": "Little Edda. Still lighting blue lamps to frighten the dark? Go home, child. There is nothing to warn anyone about any more. It's already here.",
     "do": [
      {
       "flag": "edda_spoke"
      }
     ],
     "next": "end"
    },
    "end": {
     "who": "corvin",
     "text": "Come, then. Let's see how long a knight burns."
    }
   }
  }
 },
